---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import levels from '../../../../data/german-is-easy/levels.json';

const safeJson = JSON.stringify(levels)
  .replace(/</g, '\\u003c')
  .replace(/>/g, '\\u003e')
  .replace(/&/g, '\\u0026');
---

<Layout title="German Is A̶w̶f̶u̶l̶ Easy">

<h1><span aria-label="German Is Awful, I mean, Easy">German Is <span class="crayon-strike">Awful<svg class="crayon-line" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 100 12" preserveAspectRatio="none"></svg></span> Easy</span> <button class="info-btn info-btn-title" aria-label="About this game">?</button></h1>
<p class="subtitle-row">
  <span>A puzzle game of linguistic decipherment by <a href="/">Michelle Fullwood</a>.<button class="info-btn info-btn-subtitle" aria-label="About this game">?</button></span>
</p>

<div class="info-backdrop" id="info-backdrop" style="display:none">
  <div class="info-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="About German Is Easy">
    <button class="info-modal-close" id="info-modal-close" aria-label="Close">×</button>
    <h2>About this game</h2>
    <section class="info-section">
      <h3>Was ist das?</h3>
      <p>
        <span aria-label="German Is Awful, I mean, Easy">German Is <span class="crayon-strike">Awful<svg class="crayon-line" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 100 12" preserveAspectRatio="none"></svg></span> Easy</span>
        is a puzzle game where you decipher German phrases and sentences.
        We'll start with phrases and sentences that are easy to guess using
        cognates (words from a common ancestor) and shared cultural knowledge, and
        quickly get to decoding complex sentences using your pattern recognition
        and logical induction skills.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="info-section">
      <h3>Why build this?</h3>
      <p>
        I'm trying to recapture the memories I have of wandering around Germany,
        trying to make sense of the language, and the little jolts
        of delight and recognition whenever I figured something out.
        If that sounds like something you would do, this is the game for you!
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="info-section">
      <h3 aria-label="Why scratch out awful?">Why <span class="crayon-strike">Awful<svg class="crayon-line" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 100 12" preserveAspectRatio="none"></svg></span>?</h3>
      <p>
        Mark Twain has a hilarious essay about <a href="https://faculty.georgetown.edu/jod/texts/twain.german.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">"The Awful German Language"</a>.
        (Read it, by all means, though be warned: there are spoilers.)
        And, to be honest, it can get pretty gnarly!
        (Though no gnarlier than English can be, for the unsuspecting learner.)
        However, when you're not trying to <em>produce</em> German, you can
        ignore some of the most tedious parts &mdash; and I hope that the
        remainder that we cover here is, perhaps not <em>easy</em>, but precisely
        the right level of difficulty to be fun.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="info-section">
      <h3>Do I need to know any German?</h3>
      <p>
        Absolutely not. The less the better.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="info-section">
      <h3>Will I actually learn any German?</h3>
      <p>
        That's not the goal. I hope you'll learn something <em>about</em>
        German, especially the shortcuts you can use if you do want to pick it up
        for real, and some of the logic behind the gnarliness of the language.
        If you have a great memory, you may well learn many German words,
        but that's entirely optional. The goal is those moments of epiphany!
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="info-section">
      <h3>But I already know German...</h3>
      <p>
        You may find that this game is more "German is Too Easy",
        but you may enjoy joining the dots on the common etymological
        origins of the words, or learning about the logic of German word order. 
        Give it a try!
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="info-section">
      <h3>I'm bad at remembering stuff...</h3>
      <p>
        No worries, just use the "Memory" button within each round to see
        the previous sentences in the round. And make liberal use of the hints,
        especially the free ones! If using hints stresses you out because
        points are deducted, consider playing in Casual mode.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="info-section">
      <h3>How are <em>you</em> remembering my progress?</h3>
      <p>
        Your progress is stored in the local storage of your browser.
        That means you won't be able to open it up on a different browser
        or device and continue from where you left off.
      </p>
    </section>
    <div class="info-modal-bottom">
      <button class="info-modal-close-bottom" id="info-modal-close-bottom">Start playing!</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mode-row">
  <div class="mode-selector" id="mode-selector">
    <button class="mode-btn" data-mode="casual">Casual</button>
    <button class="mode-btn" data-mode="competitive">Competitive</button>
    <button class="mode-btn" data-mode="challenging">Challenging</button>
    <button class="mode-help-btn" id="mode-help-btn" aria-label="Mode descriptions">?</button>
  </div>
  <div class="total-score-row" id="total-score-row" style="display:none">
    Total: <span id="total-score"></span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mode-modal-backdrop" id="mode-modal-backdrop" style="display:none">
  <div class="mode-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Game modes">
    <button class="mode-modal-close" id="mode-modal-close" aria-label="Close">×</button>
    <h2>Game Modes</h2>
    <dl class="mode-descriptions">
      <dt>Casual</dt>
      <dd>No score tracking, use as many hints as you like. No time restrictions on timed levels. Just explore at your own pace.</dd>
      <dt>Competitive (default)</dt>
      <dd>Scores are tracked. Hints, letter reveals, incorrect guesses on certain puzzles, and going beyond time restrictions all cost points.</dd>
      <dt>Challenging</dt>
      <dd>
        Like Competitive, except that there are no hints, only letter reveals (3 points each).
        Some words won't be easily guessable from context, so strong pattern recognition skills are a must.
        You may need some trial & error to hit upon the desired wording.
      </dd>
    </dl>
    <p class="mode-note">
      Switch modes whenever you like.
      Replay old levels to get a new score or improve a previous one.
      Your most recent score will be kept, even if you switch to
      Casual mode and back.
    </p>
    <div class="info-modal-bottom">
      <button class="info-modal-close-bottom" id="mode-modal-close-bottom">Start playing!</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="map-container" id="map-container">
  <svg id="map-svg" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
  {levels.map((level) => (
    <a class="map-node" href={`/languages/german/is-easy/level/${level.id}/`} data-level-id={level.id} data-requires={level.requires ?? ''}>
      <div class="node-title">{level.title}</div>
      <div class="node-label-row">
        <div class="node-label">{level.id}</div>
        <span class="node-status" data-status-id={level.id}></span>
      </div>
      <span class="node-score" data-score-id={level.id}></span>
    </a>
  ))}
</div>

<div class="signup-section">
  <p class="signup-prompt" id="signup-prompt">🚧 This game is in alpha, with 5 levels currently available. 🚧<br/>Would you like to be notified when new levels are added?</p>
  <form class="signup-form" id="signup-form" novalidate>
    <input type="email" id="signup-email" class="signup-input" placeholder="your@email.com" autocomplete="email" />
    <button type="submit" class="signup-btn" id="signup-btn" disabled>Notify me</button>
  </form>
  <p class="signup-message" id="signup-message" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <a href="https://forms.gle/8M9ATcgTTMYhiRC27" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="feedback-link">Tell me what you think</a>
</div>

<div class="reset-row">
  <button id="reset-btn" class="reset-btn">Reset all progress</button>
</div>

<script type="application/json" id="levels-meta" set:html={safeJson}></script>

<script>
  // @ts-nocheck
  import rough from 'roughjs';

  const STORAGE_KEY = 'gie-progress';
  const MODE_KEY    = 'gie-mode';
  const levelsData  = JSON.parse(document.getElementById('levels-meta').textContent);

  // ── Mode selector ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  let mode = localStorage.getItem(MODE_KEY) || 'competitive';

  function applyScoreVisibility(m) {
    const casual = m === 'casual';
    document.querySelectorAll('.node-score').forEach(el => {
      el.style.display = casual ? 'none' : '';
    });
    const totalRow = document.getElementById('total-score-row');
    if (totalRow && casual) totalRow.style.display = 'none';
    // Restore total row only if it has a value (it may never have been shown)
    if (totalRow && !casual && totalRow.dataset.hasScore === 'true') totalRow.style.display = '';
  }

  document.querySelectorAll('.mode-btn').forEach(btn => {
    if (btn.dataset.mode === mode) btn.classList.add('active');
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      mode = btn.dataset.mode;
      localStorage.setItem(MODE_KEY, mode);
      document.querySelectorAll('.mode-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.toggle('active', b === btn));
      applyScoreVisibility(mode);
    });
  });

  const infoBackdrop = document.getElementById('info-backdrop');
  document.querySelectorAll('.info-btn').forEach(btn => btn.addEventListener('click', () => infoBackdrop.style.display = ''));
  const closeInfo = () => infoBackdrop.style.display = 'none';
  document.getElementById('info-modal-close').addEventListener('click', closeInfo);
  document.getElementById('info-modal-close-bottom').addEventListener('click', closeInfo);
  infoBackdrop.addEventListener('click', e => { if (e.target === infoBackdrop) closeInfo(); });

  const backdrop = document.getElementById('mode-modal-backdrop');
  document.getElementById('mode-help-btn').addEventListener('click', () => backdrop.style.display = '');
  document.getElementById('mode-modal-close').addEventListener('click', () => backdrop.style.display = 'none');
  document.getElementById('mode-modal-close-bottom').addEventListener('click', () => backdrop.style.display = 'none');
  backdrop.addEventListener('click', e => { if (e.target === backdrop) backdrop.style.display = 'none'; });

  function getProgress() {
    try { return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY) || '{}'); } catch { return {}; }
  }

  const progress = getProgress();

  // ── Map layout ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  const container  = document.getElementById('map-container');
  const mapSvg     = document.getElementById('map-svg');
  const nodes      = Array.from(container.querySelectorAll('.map-node'));
  const cW         = container.offsetWidth;

  const NODE_W   = cW < 420 ? 80 : 115;
  const V_STEP   = cW < 420 ? 100 : 195;
  const MARGIN_Y = 55;

  // Serpentine layout: 5 per row on wider screens, 3 on narrow
  const PER_ROW  = cW >= 420 ? 5 : 3;
  const MARGIN_X = NODE_W / 2 + 5;
  const H_STEP   = (cW - 2 * MARGIN_X) / (PER_ROW - 1);
  const numRows  = Math.ceil(levelsData.length / PER_ROW);
  const totalH   = MARGIN_Y * 2 + (numRows - 1) * V_STEP;

  // Small deterministic vertical jitter per node for a hand-drawn feel
  const jitter = i => Math.sin(i * 2.1) * 10;

  // Odd-numbered rows (0-indexed) go right→left
  const centers = levelsData.map((_, i) => {
    const row = Math.floor(i / PER_ROW);
    const col = i % PER_ROW;
    const goingRight = row % 2 === 0;
    return {
      x: goingRight ? MARGIN_X + col * H_STEP : cW - MARGIN_X - col * H_STEP,
      y: MARGIN_Y + row * V_STEP + jitter(i)
    };
  });

  container.style.height = totalH + 'px';
  Object.assign(mapSvg.style, {
    position: 'absolute', top: '0', left: '0',
    width: cW + 'px', height: totalH + 'px',
    pointerEvents: 'none', overflow: 'visible'
  });
  mapSvg.setAttribute('width',  cW);
  mapSvg.setAttribute('height', totalH);

  // Position HTML nodes, then reveal (avoids flash of unpositioned nodes)
  nodes.forEach((node, i) => {
    const c = centers[i];
    node.style.width  = NODE_W + 'px';
    node.style.height = NODE_W + 'px';
    node.style.left   = (c.x - NODE_W / 2) + 'px';
    node.style.top    = (c.y - NODE_W / 2) + 'px';
  });
  container.style.opacity = '1';

  // ── Progress bucket helpers ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
  // Progress per level is stored as { comp: {...}, cas: {...} }.
  // Old entries without these keys are treated as 'comp' for backward compat.
  function getBucket(entry, casual) {
    if (!entry) return null;
    if ('comp' in entry || 'cas' in entry) return entry[casual ? 'cas' : 'comp'] || null;
    return casual ? null : entry;
  }

  function isAnyDone(entry) {
    if (!entry) return false;
    if ('comp' in entry || 'cas' in entry) return !!(entry.comp?.done || entry.cas?.done);
    return !!entry.done;
  }

  // ── Locked state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  const locked = levelsData.map(level =>
    level.requires ? !isAnyDone(progress[String(level.requires)]) : false
  );

  // ── Rough drawing ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  const rc = rough.svg(mapSvg);

  // Paths first so node circles render on top
  for (let i = 0; i < centers.length - 1; i++) {
    const a = centers[i];
    const b = centers[i + 1];
    const rowA = Math.floor(i / PER_ROW);
    const rowB = Math.floor((i + 1) / PER_ROW);
    let pts;
    if (rowA !== rowB) {
      // Row-change: vertical connector, pushed slightly outward
      const y0   = a.y + NODE_W / 2 + 4;
      const y1   = b.y - NODE_W / 2 - 4;
      const push = rowA % 2 === 0 ? 12 : -12;
      pts = [[a.x, y0], [a.x + push, (y0 + y1) / 2], [b.x, y1]];
    } else {
      // Same row: horizontal connector trimmed to node edges
      const goingRight = rowA % 2 === 0;
      const x0   = a.x + (goingRight ? 1 : -1) * (NODE_W / 2 + 4);
      const x1   = b.x - (goingRight ? 1 : -1) * (NODE_W / 2 + 4);
      const midY = (a.y + b.y) / 2 + Math.sin(i * 1.9) * 7;
      pts = [[x0, a.y], [(x0 + x1) / 2, midY], [x1, b.y]];
    }
    const pathEl = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path');
    pathEl.setAttribute('d', `M ${pts[0][0]},${pts[0][1]} Q ${pts[1][0]},${pts[1][1]} ${pts[2][0]},${pts[2][1]}`);
    pathEl.setAttribute('fill', 'none');
    pathEl.setAttribute('stroke', locked[i + 1] ? '#ddd' : '#15616d');
    pathEl.setAttribute('stroke-width', '5');
    pathEl.setAttribute('stroke-dasharray', '10 12');
    pathEl.setAttribute('stroke-linecap', 'round');
    mapSvg.appendChild(pathEl);
  }

  // Node circles (filled white so they sit over the path)
  centers.forEach((c, i) => {
    mapSvg.appendChild(rc.circle(c.x, c.y, NODE_W, {
      stroke: locked[i] ? '#bbb' : '#15616d',
      strokeWidth: 2,
      roughness: 0.6,
      fill: '#fff',
      fillStyle: 'solid',
      seed: i + 10
    }));
  });

  // Crayon strikethrough on h1
  document.querySelectorAll('.crayon-line').forEach(svg => {
    const rcS = rough.svg(svg);
    svg.appendChild(rcS.line(1, 6, 99, 6, { stroke: '#b91c1c', strokeWidth: 2, roughness: 2.5, seed: 12 }));
  });

  // ── Progress & locking ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  let totalScore = 0, totalMax = 0, anyScore = false;
  const isCasual = mode === 'casual';

  nodes.forEach((node, i) => {
    const level    = levelsData[i];
    const statusEl = node.querySelector('[data-status-id]');
    const scoreEl  = node.querySelector('[data-score-id]');
    const entry    = progress[String(level.id)];
    const p        = getBucket(entry, isCasual);   // current mode's bucket
    const compData = getBucket(entry, false);       // competitive score (always)

    if (locked[i]) {
      node.removeAttribute('href');
      node.classList.add('locked');
      if (statusEl) statusEl.textContent = '🔒';
      return;
    }

    if (p?.done) {
      if (statusEl) { statusEl.textContent = '✓'; statusEl.classList.add('done'); }
    } else if (p?.current) {
      if (statusEl) { statusEl.textContent = '▶'; statusEl.classList.add('in-progress'); statusEl.title = 'Resume level'; }
    }

    if (!isCasual && compData?.score != null && compData?.maxScore != null) {
      if (scoreEl) scoreEl.textContent = `${compData.score}/${compData.maxScore}`;
      totalScore += compData.score;
      totalMax   += compData.maxScore;
      anyScore    = true;
    }
  });

  if (anyScore) {
    const totalRow  = document.getElementById('total-score-row');
    const totalSpan = document.getElementById('total-score');
    if (totalRow && totalSpan) {
      totalSpan.textContent = `${totalScore} / ${totalMax} pts`;
      totalRow.dataset.hasScore = 'true';
      if (!isCasual) totalRow.style.display = '';
    }
  }

  // Enter: jump to the next playable level (first unlocked + incomplete, or first unlocked)
  const nextLevel = levelsData.find((l, i) => !locked[i] && !getBucket(progress[String(l.id)], isCasual)?.done);
  if (nextLevel) {
    const nextNode = nodes.find(n => n.dataset.levelId === String(nextLevel.id));
    if (nextNode) nextNode.classList.add('next-level');
  }
  document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if (e.key === 'Enter' && nextLevel) {
      window.location.href = `/languages/german/is-easy/level/${nextLevel.id}/`;
    }
  });

  document.getElementById('reset-btn').addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (confirm('Reset all progress? This cannot be undone.')) {
      localStorage.removeItem(STORAGE_KEY);
      location.reload();
    }
  });

  // ── Email signup ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  const SCRIPT_URL = 'https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycbw1kNfWseXUyGouJ7antjNhKNZICX6TthIPbdbSOMSZ2RX8yAC3jvUuucoSXpc9uSvB/exec';
  const signupForm = document.getElementById('signup-form');
  const signupEmail = document.getElementById('signup-email');
  const signupMessage = document.getElementById('signup-message');
  const signupBtn = document.getElementById('signup-btn');
  const isValidEmail = (v) => /^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(v);

  signupEmail.addEventListener('input', () => {
    signupBtn.disabled = !isValidEmail(signupEmail.value.trim());
  });

  signupForm.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    const email = signupEmail.value.trim();
    const btn = signupBtn;
    btn.disabled = true;
    btn.textContent = 'Sending…';
    try {
      await fetch(`${SCRIPT_URL}?email=${encodeURIComponent(email)}`, {
        method: 'GET',
        mode: 'no-cors',
      });
      signupForm.style.display = 'none';
      document.getElementById('signup-prompt').style.display = 'none';
      signupMessage.textContent = 'Thank you for playing! You\'ll be notified if/when new levels are released.';
      signupMessage.className = 'signup-message signup-success';
    } catch {
      btn.disabled = false;
      btn.textContent = 'Notify me';
      signupMessage.textContent = 'Something went wrong — please try again.';
      signupMessage.className = 'signup-message signup-error';
    }
  });
</script>

</Layout>

<style is:global>
  /* Scale this page to match the 133% zoom experience */
  :root { font-size: 21px; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    :root { font-size: 15px; }
  }
  /* Cap the game container so it doesn't stretch at low zoom levels */
  body { max-width: 900px !important; }
</style>

<style>
  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  h1 + p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .crayon-strike {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .crayon-line {
    position: absolute;
    left: -3px;
    width: calc(100% + 6px);
    height: 0.45em;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-60%);
    overflow: visible;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* ── Mode row ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .mode-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  /* ── Mode selector ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .mode-selector {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .mode-btn {
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    padding: 0.3rem 1rem;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: transparent;
    color: #999;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s, background 0.15s;
  }

  .mode-btn:hover {
    color: #15616d;
    border-color: #15616d;
  }

  .mode-btn.active {
    background: #15616d;
    border-color: #15616d;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .mode-help-btn {
    width: 1.4rem;
    height: 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid #15616d;
    background: transparent;
    color: #15616d;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0;
    transition: color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .mode-help-btn:hover {
    color: #15616d;
    border-color: #15616d;
  }

  /* ── Map ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .map-container {
    position: relative;
    margin: 2rem auto 0;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
  }

  .map-node {
    position: absolute;
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    background: transparent;
    gap: 1px;
  }

  @keyframes level-pulse {
    0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 4px 2px rgba(21, 97, 109, 0.1); }
    50%       { box-shadow: 0 0 10px 6px rgba(21, 97, 109, 0.28); }
  }
  .map-node.next-level {
    animation: level-pulse 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .map-node.locked {
    opacity: 0.4;
    cursor: default;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .node-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .node-label-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .node-label {
    font-family: 'IM Fell English', serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #888;
  }

  .node-status {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #888;
  }

  .node-status.done        { color: #2d7a3a; font-weight: 600; }
  .node-status.in-progress { color: #15616d; }

  .node-score {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: #aaa;
  }

  /* ── Total score ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .total-score-row {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #15616d;
    white-space: nowrap;
    margin-right: 0.75rem;
  }

  /* ── Mode modal ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .mode-modal-backdrop {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 100;
